  "detail": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chegou nossa </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Feijoada de 2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;com música boa, muito samba, alegria, diversidade, e claro... uma deliciosa feijoada.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-size: 14px;\">Você vai ficar de fora dessa?&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Vou te contar como vai funcionar:</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Horário de funcionamento:</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A feijoada começa a ser servida às 12h até as 14h30.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bebidas serão vendidas a parte.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Buffet + couvert artístico:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">R$ 65.00 por pessoa e pode se servir à vontade.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Inclui feijoada vegetariana.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Crianças:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">De zero a 7 anos não pagam buffet;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Até 12 anos não pagam couvert;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">De 8 a 12 anos pagam 50% do valor do Buffet;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A partir dos 13 anos pagam integralmente;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-size: 14px;\">Estamos esperando vocês, ansiosamente, para termos um sábado alegre</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0px;\">!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(107, 165, 74); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\"Um bom samba é uma forma de oração!\"&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;(Vinicius de Morais)</span></span></p>",
  "details": {
    "pt": {
      "hasInfo": true,
      "text": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chegou nossa </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Feijoada de 2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;com música boa, muito samba, alegria, diversidade, e claro... uma deliciosa feijoada.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-size: 14px;\">Você vai ficar de fora dessa?&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Vou te contar como vai funcionar:</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Horário de funcionamento:</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A feijoada começa a ser servida às 12h até as 14h30.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bebidas serão vendidas a parte.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Buffet + couvert artístico:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">R$ 65.00 por pessoa e pode se servir à vontade.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Inclui feijoada vegetariana.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">Crianças:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">De zero a 7 anos não pagam buffet;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Até 12 anos não pagam couvert;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">De 8 a 12 anos pagam 50% do valor do Buffet;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A partir dos 13 anos pagam integralmente;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0cm 1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-size: 14px;\">Estamos esperando vocês, ansiosamente, para termos um sábado alegre</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0px;\">!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(107, 165, 74); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\"Um bom samba é uma forma de oração!\"&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;(Vinicius de Morais)</span></span></p>",
      "lang": "PT"
    },
